  "id": "wb-fwi",
  "title": "World Bank Global Wildfire Hazard",
  "description": "A mirror of the World Bank's global wildfire hazard dataset. CSIRO computed it for [ThinkHazard!](https://thinkhazard.org/) from NASA's Global Fire Weather Database. Three collections hold Fire Weather Index return levels for 2, 10, and 30-year return periods on a global 0.5° grid, as cloud-optimized GeoTIFFs. Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before you query.",
